### Creating and duplicating a community's channels and categories.

## The dialog's title and its main button

channel-create = Create Channel
channel-create-category = Create Category
channel-duplicate = Duplicate Channel
channel-duplicate-category = Duplicate Category
# Under the title of a duplicate. $name is the channel or category being copied.
channel-duplicate-of = of { $name }
# Under the title. $name is the category the new channel goes in.
channel-create-in = in { $name }
channel-creating = Creating…
channel-duplicating = Duplicating…

## The form. Field labels are shown in capitals.

channel-type = Channel Type
channel-type-text = Text
    .desc = Messages, images and files
channel-type-voice = Voice
    .desc = Hang out over voice and video
channel-name = Channel Name
channel-category-name = Category Name
channel-duplicate-note = Same settings and permissions, a fresh history.
channel-private = Private Channel
channel-private-text = Only members and roles you let in can see it.
channel-private-voice = Only members and roles you let in can join it.

## Suggested names, in the empty name field

channel-placeholder-category = New Category
channel-placeholder-voice = Lounge
# Text channel names are lower case with words joined by hyphens.
channel-placeholder-text = new-channel
